Package: cernal
Title: Client for the CERNAL RNA Logic Circuit Design API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("iGEM TAU 2026 Team", "Tel Aviv University", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "team@example.org")
Description: A thin client for the CERNAL API (docs/public-api.md): submit a
    differential-expression table or a trigger mRNA sequence, poll for ranked RNA
    logic circuit designs, and read the results as a tibble. Wraps five HTTP calls,
    not all 32 endpoints — anyone needing more talks to the documented REST API
    directly.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
